DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44801::$$$message_0391_0000_0000$$$::"Ayaka, would you like to stop for lunch? This estate is fully furnished, so it's an ideal rest stop."::
44802::$$$message_0391_0000_0001$$$::"It feels oddly familiar. I especially like that shed. It must have been built by a renowned architect."::
44803::$$$message_0391_0000_0002$$$::"I'm curious about what's in the house. I just have an itch to jump someone from the ceiling. Why are Japanese houses so full of places to ambush people from?"::
44804::$$$message_0391_0000_0003$$$::"I like that wall. It's no skyscraper, but it has a unique charm. Maybe I'll go stand on it."::
44805::$$$message_0391_0000_0004$$$::"Y-you're embarrassing me, so stay where you are! [wvl][hfwww layer=2]What are you, a bunch of schoolboys on a field trip!?"::
44806::$$$message_0391_0000_0005$$$::"My apologies. You're right. We should behave ourselves, even in enemy territory. Unfortunately, we probably shouldn't have lunch here."::
44807::$$$message_0391_0000_0006$$$::"But we still need to rest. Aren't you tired, Ayaka?"::
44808::$$$message_0391_0000_0007$$$::"Y-yeah. I'm used to the hanafuda battles now, but still..."::
44810::$$$message_0391_0000_0009$$$::"Doesn't this town feel weird to you? All the people we've walked by seem so lifeless, with dead fish eyes..."::
44811::$$$message_0391_0000_0010$$$::"Perhaps it's just a quirk of the local culture. Look, there's a dock over there. The kind of place where tentacled sea monsters emerge to enslave humans."::
44812::$$$message_0391_0000_0011$$$::"Like in 'The Call of Caller,' right? You have such grim taste in books, Ayaka."::
44813::$$$message_0391_0000_0012$$$::"Th-they're not grim! Who cares about my preferences? We're talking about the people and their dead fish eyes! See, look at that one!"::
44814::$$$message_0391_0000_0013$$$::"...................................................Om nom nom."::
44815::$$$message_0391_0000_0014$$$::"Those...eyes certainly are lifeless!"::
44816::$$$message_0391_0000_0015$$$::"He hasn't noticed us... He's been chewing on a piece of plastic in the shadows..."::
44817::$$$message_0391_0000_0016$$$::".....................[resumevoice][hfsigh layer=2].........Yeah."::
44818::$$$message_0391_0000_0017$$$::"This is Iri's home cooking. I'll eat it. I have to. Even if it's a rice ball as hard as depleted uranium."::
44819::$$$message_0391_0000_0018$$$::"Om nom nom. Ahh... I'm a happy man... Damn it... That must be why I'm crying..."::
44820::$$$message_0391_0000_0019$$$::"I think we should leave him alone. He's creeping me out."::
44821::$$$message_0391_0000_0020$$$::"I know you took time to make me this lunch, Saber, but I want to get out of here. Sorry. I'll save it for later... [wvl][hffgchg2 chara=綾香 face=驚き3 pos=left time=300 twno=1 textclear=0][fg left=243 index=610000 top=201 time=10 storage=hf_ダメージベース opacity=0 layer=4][move spread=1 mx=300 magnify=0.667 time=100 my=261 path=(300,261,255,1)(300,261,0,2) storage=hf_ダメージベース accel=-2 layer=4][hfchance layer=0]Saber!?"::
44822::$$$message_0391_0000_0021$$$::"Om nom nom. What nostalgic, wild seasoning. Not bad."::
44823::$$$message_0391_0000_0022$$$::"Ah, may I have a cup of tea, my lady? My hands are full with this turkey."::
44824::$$$message_0391_0000_0023$$$::"S-Saber turned into a girl...!? W-w-what's going on!?"::
44825::$$$message_0391_0000_0024$$$::"Ouch... Who struck me on the head from behind? What an unchivalrous act... [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーprt face=驚き pos=left time=300 twno=1 textclear=0][fg left=243 index=610000 top=201 time=10 storage=hf_ダメージベース opacity=0 layer=5][move spread=1 mx=300 magnify=0.667 time=100 my=261 path=(300,261,255,1)(300,261,0,2) storage=hf_ダメージベース accel=-2 layer=5][hfsweat layer=0 ox=-20 oy=30][hfchance layer=0]Wait, who are you!?"::
44826::$$$message_0391_0000_0025$$$::"Heh. You're as soft as you look, Pendragon. I've been eating a succulent meal while you were spacing out."::
44827::$$$message_0391_0000_0026$$$::"If you're trying to show off, it's not working! Who are you!? Don't tell me... His little sister!?"::
44828::$$$message_0391_0000_0027$$$::"I'd like to know the same thing! Who in the world are you!? If you call yourself a knight, then name yourself!"::
44829::$$$message_0391_0000_0028$$$::"Heh. What a farce, saying that after capturing yourself. I am your shadow, and one of your possible futures."::
44830::$$$message_0391_0000_0029$$$::"Take up your blade, sacred sword wielder. Let's see how much power the prototype version has."::
44831::$$$message_0391_0000_0030$$$::"Why do I feel so incredibly let down...?"::
44832::$$$message_0391_0000_0031$$$::"Still, I can see that you are a Saber-class Servant. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーprt face=怒2 pos=left time=300 textclear=0][hfwww layer=0]That makes you a worthy opponent. Lancer, Archer, don't interf[line len=2][wvl canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーprt face=驚き pos=left time=300 textclear=0][hfchance layer=0]What!?"[skip_next_tag][br]::
44833::$$$message_0391_0000_0032$$$::"Whoa, what the hell is this eagle!? Stop plucking my feathers! They aren't for your nest!"::
44834::$$$message_0391_0000_0033$$$::"Away with you, foul beasts! Why is there a gorilla by the wall!? And a lowland one, at that! [wvl][hfangry layer=0]Stop shaking me! Cease, I say!"::
44835::$$$message_0391_0000_0034$$$::"Hehehehehe. Get them, Wire Zoo friends!"::
44836::$$$message_0391_0000_0035$$$::"Flying Guillotine (the eagle's name), get that Lancer who isn't wearing tights!"::
44837::$$$message_0391_0000_0036$$$::"Brother Gatling (the gorilla's name), seize that nudist Archer! [wvl canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=アイリ face=酔い pos=center time=400 twno=1][hfsigh layer=2]I knew I was right to make a gorilla! Yahoo, the power of primates is something else!"::
44838::$$$message_0391_0000_0037$$$::"Iri... What happened to you? No, I should just observe. I need to figure out what happened to both of them!"::
44839::$$$message_0391_0000_0038$$$::"Hehehe, ahahahaha![humming] I won't forgive anyone who tries to ruin home sweet home with Kiritsugu!"::
44840::$$$message_0391_0000_0039$$$::"Prepare for pain! I'll spank you until your butt is raw and kick you out onto the street, penniless!"::
44841::$$$message_0391_0000_0040$$$::"And over here, there's an incredibly beautiful woman who's incredibly drunk!"::
44842::$$$message_0391_0000_0041$$$::"What the heck is happening in this town!?"::

